    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SECRETS OF THE MYSTERIOUS ISLAND</strong><br>A cryptic message from your missing father leads you to a remote island shrouded in dark secrets. Once the site of secret experiments, the island is now haunted each night by a strange, mystical beam that reactivates abandoned electronics and awakens monstrous creatures. What really happened here? And what part did your father play in it all? The answers may be closer than you think\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SURVIVE AT ANY COST</strong><br>Explore a vast and perilous island, scavenging for food, fuel, medicine, and ammunition. Be ready to fight for your life against aggressive zombies and equally dangerous survivors. Build, fortify, and defend your shelter, craft weapons, and prepare to face each night fully armed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/2226e179984c7d716dba570c4b65694c.poster.avif?t=1754489420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/2226e179984c7d716dba570c4b65694c.webm?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/2226e179984c7d716dba570c4b65694c.mp4?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE FARM \u2014 YOUR NEW HOME</strong><br>Once abandoned, your father's old farm has become your refuge and workshop. Restore and upgrade it, grow supplies to weather the island\u2019s hardships. Turn it into a cozy, reliable home \u2014 a safe haven from the dangers beyond its fences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/78e0fdf20803243ca8c84e1a728d57c4.poster.avif?t=1754489420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/78e0fdf20803243ca8c84e1a728d57c4.webm?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/78e0fdf20803243ca8c84e1a728d57c4.mp4?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>YOUR VEHICLE \u2014 YOUR GREATEST ALLY</strong><br>Your car is the cornerstone of survival and the key to exploring the island. Haul resources, building materials, and loot; deliver logs to the sawmill and bring supplies back to the farm. Upgrade and customize it to enhance power, durability, and looks. Just don\u2019t forget to refuel \u2014 or you might find yourself stranded when you need it most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/a47b8172722aa1b072831c262a8dc037.poster.avif?t=1754489420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/a47b8172722aa1b072831c262a8dc037.webm?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/a47b8172722aa1b072831c262a8dc037.mp4?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHEN NIGHT FALLS\u2026</strong><br>As the sun sets, the island transforms. A mysterious night-time beam reactivates old machinery \u2014 giving you the chance to refuel at deserted stations, smelt scrap, or access previously sealed bunkers. But beware: with the machines come the island\u2019s mutated creatures, awakened and ready to tear apart anything in their path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/4759dd5583b0a05e0daab8dbf9501e42.poster.avif?t=1754489420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/4759dd5583b0a05e0daab8dbf9501e42.webm?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/4759dd5583b0a05e0daab8dbf9501e42.mp4?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HUMANITY\u2019S LAST HOPE</strong><br>Uncover the dark truths of Outbreak Island \u2014 and perhaps you\u2019ll become the last hope to save humanity from a looming catastrophe.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SECRETS OF THE MYSTERIOUS ISLAND</strong><br>A cryptic message from your missing father leads you to a remote island shrouded in dark secrets. Once the site of secret experiments, the island is now haunted each night by a strange, mystical beam that reactivates abandoned electronics and awakens monstrous creatures. What really happened here? And what part did your father play in it all? The answers may be closer than you think\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SURVIVE AT ANY COST</strong><br>Explore a vast and perilous island, scavenging for food, fuel, medicine, and ammunition. Be ready to fight for your life against aggressive zombies and equally dangerous survivors. Build, fortify, and defend your shelter, craft weapons, and prepare to face each night fully armed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/2226e179984c7d716dba570c4b65694c.poster.avif?t=1754489420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/2226e179984c7d716dba570c4b65694c.webm?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/2226e179984c7d716dba570c4b65694c.mp4?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE FARM \u2014 YOUR NEW HOME</strong><br>Once abandoned, your father's old farm has become your refuge and workshop. Restore and upgrade it, grow supplies to weather the island\u2019s hardships. Turn it into a cozy, reliable home \u2014 a safe haven from the dangers beyond its fences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/78e0fdf20803243ca8c84e1a728d57c4.poster.avif?t=1754489420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/78e0fdf20803243ca8c84e1a728d57c4.webm?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/78e0fdf20803243ca8c84e1a728d57c4.mp4?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>YOUR VEHICLE \u2014 YOUR GREATEST ALLY</strong><br>Your car is the cornerstone of survival and the key to exploring the island. Haul resources, building materials, and loot; deliver logs to the sawmill and bring supplies back to the farm. Upgrade and customize it to enhance power, durability, and looks. Just don\u2019t forget to refuel \u2014 or you might find yourself stranded when you need it most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/a47b8172722aa1b072831c262a8dc037.poster.avif?t=1754489420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/a47b8172722aa1b072831c262a8dc037.webm?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/a47b8172722aa1b072831c262a8dc037.mp4?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHEN NIGHT FALLS\u2026</strong><br>As the sun sets, the island transforms. A mysterious night-time beam reactivates old machinery \u2014 giving you the chance to refuel at deserted stations, smelt scrap, or access previously sealed bunkers. But beware: with the machines come the island\u2019s mutated creatures, awakened and ready to tear apart anything in their path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/4759dd5583b0a05e0daab8dbf9501e42.poster.avif?t=1754489420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/4759dd5583b0a05e0daab8dbf9501e42.webm?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442530/extras/4759dd5583b0a05e0daab8dbf9501e42.mp4?t=1754489420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HUMANITY\u2019S LAST HOPE</strong><br>Uncover the dark truths of Outbreak Island \u2014 and perhaps you\u2019ll become the last hope to save humanity from a looming catastrophe.</p>",
